    "en": "Backrooms: Code Yellow is a 1-6 player online co-op game where you delve into an infinitely massive unpredictable realm of endless rooms, hallways and distorted architecture. Work together to explore, complete tasks, collect data, and return to earn funding for the next days work. But don’t get too comfortable. You may not be alone."
